      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f4c8dbdffa0e01bd654694a|full_name}: The request here is when the name gets shortened to three letters. In nameplate options you can still choose to show icon only. Now for non-subscribers does it shorten the name to three letters or not. For example my name gets shortened to Obs. Luckily its not the first time ive been called that so I dont mind the shorter nickname but that is what this request is all about trying to solve the odd shortening.\nA customisable image is the vrc+ perk but that does not mean there should be no other method or free icons that everyone can utilise.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
